            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/po/approve",
            "description": "JWT Client only. Same call as TSPL SAP collection PO_Approve.\n\nBFF fetches CSRF (`Request_Type=Fetch_Token`, `x-csrf-token=fetch`), then POST `{JWT.baseurl}/ZPO_APPROVE_API/PO?sap-client={JWT.sapclientid}`.\nHeaders to SAP: `Request_Type=PO_Approve`, `Po_Num`, `App_Reject`, `Com_Field`, `SY-UNAME` (JWT sapuser), `x-csrf-token`, Basic Auth (decrypted JWT password).\n\nPayload: `Po_Num`, `App_Reject` (`A` approve / `R` reject), optional `Com_Field`, `sapsystemid`.\nSuccess: `{ data: { Po_Num, App_Reject, result } }`."
          }
        }
